ds.\n\nGold: heroine-type girl, cheat skill character. Gives unconditional love.\n\nBlack: noble daughter, commander girl. Gives conditional love only.\n\nWhite: stoic genius mage. Cares more for self. Star magician.\n\nPink: chaotic bright miko. Cares more for others. Rainbow dancer.\n\nSilver:  overworked holy sister. Flawless qualities, has bad luck.\n\nPurple: 1st princess. A gentle but lonely girl. Queen of orchids.\n\nOrange: 2nd princess, Younger sister villainess type. Orange rose.\n\nNavy: royal maid, retainer, professional loafer.\n\nMaroon: professional assassin, retainer, common-sense girl.\n\nBrown: cafe maid boss, coffee girl.\n\nOpal: music composer and theatre girl. Reckless type.\n\nAnything is fine! \n\nThank you very much for your time!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tg-HEjnr8RJ8h-nrW-Um0YfQxp22FEg7", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@TEokiba/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/21422c4f/uploads/origins/90f68f39-3029-40cb-ac46-3d15edcf71ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1c11aebf1a5a3e4bd9f3ac4384ec89ff", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/21422c4f/uploads/origins/90f68f39-3029-40cb-ac46-3d15edcf71ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1c11aebf1a5a3e4bd9f3ac4384ec89ff, https://si.imgix.net/21422c4f/uploads/origins/90f68f39-3029-40cb-ac46-3d15edcf71ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=69f2edd1b026c986598e020ea04b9333 2x, https://si.imgix.net/21422c4f/uploads/origins/90f68f39-3029-40cb-ac46-3d15edcf71ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&